abstract: >-
  This is a Claude Skill packaging Lily Design System documentation for an AI coding agent.
  It is one subproject of Lily Design System, a free open-source headless
  design system whose canonical catalog of 661 components is implemented
  across ten frameworks. Its source is the lily-design-system-migrate-from-bootstrap directory
  of the canonical monorepo at https://github.com/LilyDesignSystem/lily-design-system.
